This project benchmarks the tokenizer of SMG (Shepherd Model Gateway),
https://github.com/smg-project/smg, Copyright 2024 SMG Team, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The harness and scripts were first written in a fork of SMG
(https://github.com/bhargavchintam/smg, branch bhargavchintam/fast-encode-bench)
and then moved here. The release profile in Cargo.toml and the settings in
.cargo/config.toml come from SMG at commit
33dd6c4e717b0370d09f0817de82d10a5a50ec6e. The harness builds against SMG's
published llm-tokenizer crate and compares it with the tokenizers and
fastokens crates, which keep their own licenses.
